  m_Text: "\u0130lk tur A\u2192B, ikinci tur B\u2192A \xF6nerilir.\nK\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131
    alan sald\u0131r\u0131 haz\u0131rl\u0131\u011F\u0131d\u0131r; tur modunda d\xFC\u015Fman
    menziline dikkat et.\nHer dalga sonras\u0131 ya\u015Fayan ekip +4 can al\u0131r.
    Finalde tekrar oynama iste\u011Fini puanla."
